                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "BvpID",
                                      "name": "P1",
                                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "近 12 个月，CNCF 毕业项目中网络与 GitOps 层变化最快，发行版本身不再是主战场。",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                                      "fontSize": 12,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "cc9t1",
                                      "name": "H2",
                                      "fill": "$text",
                                      "content": "## 项目图谱",
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                                      "fontSize": 14,
                                      "fontWeight": "600"
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "QJK2U",
                                      "name": "P2",
                                      "fill": "$text-muted",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": "fill_container",
                                      "content": "Kubernetes 仍是控制面事实标准。Cilium 在 eBPF 数据平面上替代 kube-proxy；Istio 与 Ambient 路线并存；Argo CD 成为 GitOps 默认入口。",
                                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                                      "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                                      "fontSize": 12,
                                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                                    },
